      "content": "thanks. one thing i'm worried about is the \"erase all personal data\" part. specifically, how do we ensure that there aren't any \"hidden\" traces left behind in old logs or deep backups that might be overlooked during the deletion process? what's the best way to verify everything is actually gone?",
