      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm just concerned about the potential for \"mischievous\" or unintended data retention—like when a system has some weird, automated process that just keeps recreating or reviving old data fragments without anyone knowing. how do we protect against those kinds of unpredictable little glitches that might keep certain bits of info \"alive\" in the background?",
